WEBVTT

00:01.910 --> 00:05.840
<b>20 years agoin Kamiya</b>

00:20.350 --> 00:21.730
<b>Hey!</b>

00:21.890 --> 00:24.600
<b>Don't do that in front of my shop!
Now scram!</b>

00:29.110 --> 00:31.610
<b>That goes for you too, kiddo.</b>

00:32.360 --> 00:33.780
<b>Sir.</b>

00:33.950 --> 00:36.530
<b>Is that how you speak to your customers?</b>

00:36.700 --> 00:38.450
<b>A customer?</b>

00:38.620 --> 00:41.870
<b>Yeah, I'm a customer who's here to shop.</b>

00:42.040 --> 00:44.040
<b>If you speak to your customers like that,</b>

00:44.210 --> 00:45.710
<b>you'll go out of business.</b>

00:45.880 --> 00:47.670
<b>So you're a customer, eh?</b>

00:47.840 --> 00:49.210
<b>Then what are you buying?</b>

00:49.380 --> 00:50.880
<b>Let's see.</b>

00:51.050 --> 00:54.300
<b>What is it? What are you here to buy?</b>

00:54.470 --> 00:55.840
<b>That.</b>

00:56.010 --> 00:59.050
<b>I'm here to buy two water jugs.</b>

00:59.560 --> 01:00.600
<b>What?!</b>

01:00.760 --> 01:02.810
<b>-Who's kid is that?
-Who?</b>

01:02.980 --> 01:04.350
<b>That's Otomatsu, the bully.</b>

01:04.520 --> 01:06.810
<b>That notorious kid.</b>

01:06.980 --> 01:08.560
<b>I'll buy them.</b>

01:09.320 --> 01:10.570
<b>What are you saying?</b>

01:10.730 --> 01:12.280
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

01:12.440 --> 01:13.990
<b>I'm not kidding.</b>

01:14.150 --> 01:17.110
<b>I'm taking home two water jugs.</b>

01:17.280 --> 01:20.240
<b>Nonsense! A tiny kid like you</b>

01:20.410 --> 01:23.120
<b>won't be able to carry these big jugs!</b>

01:23.290 --> 01:24.290
<b>I can.</b>

01:24.460 --> 01:26.710
<b>I can do it with my own hands.</b>

01:26.870 --> 01:29.540
<b>All right, then I'll sell it to you.</b>

01:29.710 --> 01:30.710
<b>How much?</b>

01:30.880 --> 01:32.460
<b>It's three mon per jug.</b>

01:32.630 --> 01:34.170
<b>How cheap.</b>

01:35.130 --> 01:37.680
<b>I could buy a piece of candy with that.</b>

01:38.590 --> 01:39.890
<b>Keep the change.</b>

01:41.060 --> 01:42.100
<b>What a bigmouth.</b>

01:42.260 --> 01:43.720
<b>He's putting an adult to shame!</b>

01:43.890 --> 01:45.140
<b>You brat!</b>

01:45.310 --> 01:47.810
<b>Let's see you lug it back home.</b>

01:47.980 --> 01:49.650
<b>Both of them, by yourself!</b>

01:50.230 --> 01:51.860
<b>Come on, take it!</b>

01:52.020 --> 01:54.070
<b>What's the holdup?</b>

01:54.240 --> 01:57.530
<b>If you can't take them,
I won't let you get away that easily.</b>

02:14.920 --> 02:15.920
<b>Hey!</b>

02:16.090 --> 02:17.380
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

02:17.550 --> 02:18.760
<b>Sir.</b>

02:18.930 --> 02:21.930
<b>Broken pieces are easier for me to carry by myself.</b>

02:22.970 --> 02:25.270
<b>The water jugs I purchased belong to me.</b>

02:25.430 --> 02:27.810
<b>Because I bought them,</b>

02:27.980 --> 02:29.940
<b>I'm free to do whatever I want, right?</b>

02:31.060 --> 02:33.940
<b>I see. The kid's got a point.</b>

02:34.820 --> 02:36.650
<b>You're being played by a kid.</b>

02:36.820 --> 02:39.200
<b>Boy, what a smart kid!</b>

02:41.030 --> 02:43.370
<b>-All right!
-You did it, kiddo!</b>

02:43.530 --> 02:45.120
<b>Listen, sir.</b>

02:45.290 --> 02:48.580
<b>I never promised you that I would
carry them all at once.</b>

02:48.750 --> 02:52.130
<b>I just said I would carry them myself.</b>

02:52.290 --> 02:54.750
<b>I'll be back multiple times to take the rest,</b>

02:54.920 --> 02:57.010
<b>so leave them here for me.</b>

02:57.170 --> 02:59.720
<b>Dang it, you brat!</b>

03:00.260 --> 03:01.760
<b>How impressive.</b>

03:01.930 --> 03:03.470
<b>I second that.</b>

03:03.640 --> 03:06.720
<b>He's gonna be a big-shot.</b>

04:09.330 --> 04:10.870
<b>Would you look at that.</b>

04:11.370 --> 04:13.420
<b>We've got sweetfish today.</b>

04:13.580 --> 04:15.710
<b>This is a luxury.</b>

04:15.880 --> 04:17.290
<b>Wasn't it expensive?</b>

04:17.880 --> 04:20.010
<b>Don't you worry about it.</b>

04:20.760 --> 04:22.260
<b>Thank you for your hard work.</b>

04:22.930 --> 04:25.340
<b>It is my pleasure.</b>

04:26.680 --> 04:30.270
<b>Now it's time to eat and appreciate this beauty!</b>

04:32.480 --> 04:35.060
<b>Father, Father, Father!</b>

04:35.230 --> 04:36.400
<b>Ojun?</b>

04:38.900 --> 04:40.360
<b>Father, look!</b>

04:40.530 --> 04:41.740
<b>Isn't that amazing?</b>

04:41.900 --> 04:42.990
<b>It is!</b>

04:43.150 --> 04:46.660
<b>Ojun, your father is having dinner right now.</b>

04:46.820 --> 04:47.830
<b>Don't be rude!</b>

04:48.990 --> 04:52.200
<b>But he's always busy.</b>

04:52.370 --> 04:54.210
<b>Off you go.</b>

04:54.370 --> 04:56.540
<b>No way!</b>

04:57.670 --> 04:58.840
<b>Ojun!</b>

04:59.000 --> 05:01.130
<b>How could you do that to your mother?!</b>

05:01.300 --> 05:02.550
<b>Wait, Ojun!</b>

05:02.720 --> 05:03.720
<b>Catch me if you can!</b>

05:03.880 --> 05:05.220
<b>Stop running!</b>

05:05.380 --> 05:07.720
<b>There, there, both of you.</b>

05:21.650 --> 05:23.940
<b>Ojun!</b>

05:27.660 --> 05:30.280
<b>Ojun!</b>

05:30.450 --> 05:32.700
<b>Ojun.</b>

05:32.870 --> 05:33.910
<b>Hey.</b>

05:34.080 --> 05:37.170
<b>Cheer up, let's play a game.</b>

05:42.670 --> 05:46.720
<b>I might've been a little too hard on her.</b>

05:46.880 --> 05:48.930
<b>Excuse me, chief.</b>

05:50.850 --> 05:53.680
<b>May I have a word with you?</b>

05:54.220 --> 05:57.600
<b>What do you mean by hesitating
in our discussion?</b>

05:57.770 --> 06:00.150
<b>It's about Gohei Ishikawa.</b>

06:00.310 --> 06:02.820
<b>We captured him through Hikojyu's tip-off.</b>

06:03.530 --> 06:06.820
<b>Anyway, he has a way with words.</b>

06:07.700 --> 06:11.830
<b>If you think I stole it, show me the evidence.</b>

06:12.410 --> 06:15.500
<b>I'm sure you just acted on a spy's testimony.</b>

06:15.660 --> 06:18.210
<b>That spy's a former thief.</b>

06:18.370 --> 06:21.250
<b>You choose to trust his word</b>

06:21.420 --> 06:24.590
<b>rather than an honest civilian like me?</b>

06:25.090 --> 06:26.470
<b>How do you explain that?</b>

06:27.420 --> 06:28.680
<b>Hikojyu.</b>

06:28.840 --> 06:31.430
<b>You're absolutely sure he's Gohei Ishikawa?</b>

06:31.600 --> 06:33.760
<b>Of course!</b>

06:33.930 --> 06:36.930
<b>He's got the freakish scar from a burn.</b>

06:37.100 --> 06:39.310
<b>I can assure you that's him.</b>

06:39.480 --> 06:41.270
<b>A scar from a burn?</b>

06:42.770 --> 06:45.320
<b>Anyhow, Shinbei the Viper's clan,</b>

06:45.860 --> 06:50.070
<b>notorious for murder and rape.</b>

06:52.280 --> 06:54.580
<b>If Gohei is in Edo,</b>

06:54.740 --> 06:57.960
<b>they must be planning a job here.</b>

06:58.410 --> 06:59.580
<b>Am I right, Hikojyu?</b>

06:59.750 --> 07:00.750
<b>Yes.</b>

07:00.920 --> 07:05.420
<b>We need the location of their hideout to find out
when and where they'll hit the target.</b>

07:05.630 --> 07:06.960
<b>Get it out of him.</b>

07:07.130 --> 07:09.470
<b>Of course, we understand.</b>

07:09.720 --> 07:13.640
<b>Don't tell me you got stumped too.</b>

07:13.800 --> 07:15.510
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

07:15.680 --> 07:19.230
<b>Sajima is trying to talk to him at the moment.</b>

07:19.390 --> 07:21.310
<b>But it doesn't seem too promising either.</b>

07:21.480 --> 07:22.560
<b>Is that so?</b>

07:22.730 --> 07:25.570
<b>I'm curious to see this man.</b>

07:36.450 --> 07:37.830
<b>That's him.</b>

07:38.000 --> 07:41.250
<b>I feel like I met him a long time ago...</b>

07:42.460 --> 07:44.630
<b>I'm very sorry.</b>

07:52.970 --> 07:54.140
<b>It's him!</b>

07:57.890 --> 07:59.430
<b>It's Otomatsu!</b>

08:01.810 --> 08:03.270
<b>-How impressive.
-I second that.</b>

08:03.650 --> 08:05.020
<b>He's gonna be a big shot.</b>

08:07.070 --> 08:08.480
<b>Take that!</b>

08:08.650 --> 08:11.610
<b>Adult men all lack wisdom!</b>

08:11.780 --> 08:14.320
<b>Especially the man in my house!</b>

08:19.870 --> 08:21.080
<b>Mother...</b>

08:21.250 --> 08:23.920
<b>I wonder what she likes about him.</b>

08:26.540 --> 08:27.840
<b>Who are you?</b>

08:28.420 --> 08:29.670
<b>Stop!</b>

08:33.010 --> 08:34.180
<b>I knew it.</b>

08:35.390 --> 08:37.680
<b>I thought I saw something just now.</b>

08:40.600 --> 08:42.270
<b>-Are you...
-Shut up!</b>

08:42.430 --> 08:43.440
<b>How about that scar?</b>

08:43.600 --> 08:45.850
<b>It's none of your business!</b>

08:52.950 --> 08:54.700
<b>What was up with him?</b>

09:03.460 --> 09:05.620
<b>Hey, Otomatsu.</b>

09:05.790 --> 09:07.080
<b>Where is he?</b>

09:07.250 --> 09:09.380
<b>He's your father.</b>

09:09.540 --> 09:12.090
<b>My father died four years ago.</b>

09:12.260 --> 09:13.840
<b>He's just a guy.</b>

09:14.010 --> 09:15.800
<b>He's out gambling.</b>

09:15.970 --> 09:18.180
<b>He'll probably come back broke.</b>

09:18.350 --> 09:20.100
<b>Here, take this and leave.</b>

09:22.350 --> 09:26.650
<b>He's quiet as long as you're not here, okay?</b>

09:27.690 --> 09:29.520
<b>My, welcome back.</b>

09:31.650 --> 09:34.530
<b>What are you staring at, you brat?</b>

09:38.950 --> 09:42.830
<b>Trying to make a fool out of me? Huh?!</b>

09:43.000 --> 09:45.290
<b>This isn't a show! Dang it!</b>

10:21.580 --> 10:22.660
<b>It's him...</b>

10:24.160 --> 10:25.540
<b>Who are you?</b>

10:26.370 --> 10:29.420
<b>You heard of Onitetsu of Honjo?
That's me.</b>

10:29.580 --> 10:30.880
<b>You're the...</b>

10:31.290 --> 10:34.710
<b>Swear to me that you'll never lay
another hand on Otomatsu again.</b>

10:36.420 --> 10:37.720
<b>Swear it!</b>

10:37.920 --> 10:42.180
<b>I promise! I'll never lay another hand
on Otomatsu again.</b>

10:47.100 --> 10:50.440
<b>If he does it again, come to me.</b>

10:51.690 --> 10:54.730
<b>Look for the Hasegawa house in Honjo, all right?</b>

10:56.740 --> 10:58.150
<b>Goodbye.</b>

10:58.320 --> 11:00.200
<b>Hey!</b>

11:01.450 --> 11:03.280
<b>Thanks.</b>

11:13.500 --> 11:16.000
<b>But why, Otomatsu?</b>

11:20.220 --> 11:23.260
<b>It's been a while, Otomatsu.</b>

11:26.430 --> 11:28.180
<b>Tell me why.</b>

11:29.270 --> 11:31.940
<b>What happened to you?</b>

11:35.070 --> 11:37.030
<b>I don't know what I was expecting.</b>

11:38.280 --> 11:41.780
<b>Don't you know that this is all your fault?</b>

11:43.990 --> 11:44.990
<b>It's true.</b>

11:45.160 --> 11:47.950
<b>He calmed down quite a bit for a while after that.</b>

11:48.120 --> 11:51.120
<b>But that didn't last too long.</b>

11:51.290 --> 11:53.920
<b>He started to beat me again.</b>

11:54.500 --> 11:56.960
<b>Because he was warned by you,</b>

11:57.130 --> 11:58.420
<b>he got even more violent.</b>

12:04.260 --> 12:07.310
<b>You didn't go to the magistrate's office?</b>

12:07.470 --> 12:09.100
<b>Of course I did.</b>

12:09.270 --> 12:10.810
<b>But I was ignored.</b>

12:10.980 --> 12:13.100
<b>It was dismissed as a family quarrel.</b>

12:13.770 --> 12:17.730
<b>Onihei, I even went to your big mansion.</b>

12:17.900 --> 12:20.150
<b>Just like we promised.</b>

12:20.320 --> 12:23.780
<b>But I was turned away at the gate
for looking like a miser.</b>

12:25.320 --> 12:27.870
<b>But Chief was stationed in Kyoto at the time.</b>

12:28.030 --> 12:29.240
<b>Don't, Koyanagi.</b>

12:29.410 --> 12:30.450
<b>But...</b>

12:30.620 --> 12:32.460
<b>That's about official duty.</b>

12:32.620 --> 12:34.880
<b>It has nothing to do with Otomatsu.</b>

12:35.540 --> 12:37.630
<b>And that night...</b>

12:38.040 --> 12:41.050
<b>You were at Onitetsu's, weren't you?!</b>

12:48.140 --> 12:50.520
<b>Stop! That's enough!</b>

12:50.930 --> 12:51.930
<b>Shut up!</b>

12:52.680 --> 12:53.890
<b>Mother.</b>

12:54.310 --> 12:55.350
<b>What's wrong with you!</b>

12:55.770 --> 12:58.020
<b>Trying to make a fool out of me?!</b>

12:58.190 --> 12:59.190
<b>Damn it!</b>

13:01.610 --> 13:03.450
<b>Please, stop.</b>

13:31.680 --> 13:33.850
<b>Mother, I...</b>

13:35.810 --> 13:37.100
<b>Murderer.</b>

13:38.900 --> 13:40.190
<b>I should've...</b>

13:40.360 --> 13:42.360
<b>I should've never given birth to you!</b>

13:48.990 --> 13:52.370
<b>After that, I left Edo by myself.</b>

13:52.910 --> 13:55.120
<b>I was only 12 at the time.</b>

13:57.080 --> 13:58.960
<b>So now you know, Onihei.</b>

13:59.130 --> 14:01.090
<b>It's all your fault.</b>

14:01.250 --> 14:04.510
<b>I'm the monster you created.</b>

14:04.670 --> 14:06.300
<b>Isn't that right?</b>

14:06.470 --> 14:09.090
<b>You're just resenting him in return!</b>

14:09.260 --> 14:10.390
<b>Stop, Sakai.</b>

14:10.550 --> 14:11.550
<b>But!</b>

14:11.720 --> 14:13.850
<b>So I spilled it all.</b>

14:14.020 --> 14:16.390
<b>Why don't you execute me already?</b>

14:16.560 --> 14:19.520
<b>I won't tell you anything beyond that.</b>

14:20.440 --> 14:22.020
<b>Is that so...</b>

14:22.980 --> 14:26.650
<b>What a miserable man, that Gohei.</b>

14:26.820 --> 14:28.740
<b>He's been that way since he was 12.</b>

14:28.910 --> 14:31.620
<b>He was meant to be a criminal.</b>

14:31.950 --> 14:34.790
<b>But I'm not trying to defend him at all.</b>

14:35.700 --> 14:37.370
<b>I know.</b>

14:37.540 --> 14:40.880
<b>But what's going on in his head now?</b>

14:43.420 --> 14:44.800
<b>Hey!</b>

14:44.960 --> 14:46.590
<b>-Over here!
-That's Onihei's</b>

14:46.760 --> 14:48.760
<b>wife and daughter?</b>

14:48.930 --> 14:51.010
<b>Be quiet and walk.</b>

14:51.850 --> 14:54.510
<b>His wife gave birth when she was past 40?</b>

14:54.680 --> 14:56.560
<b>She must be very active.</b>

14:56.730 --> 14:58.480
<b>Don't be mistaken.</b>

14:58.640 --> 15:00.400
<b>Chief and his wife</b>

15:00.560 --> 15:02.730
<b>adopted Ojun who was a child of a thief...</b>

15:02.900 --> 15:04.020
<b>Koyanagi!</b>

15:04.190 --> 15:07.780
<b>They're raising her as if she was their own?</b>

15:13.740 --> 15:15.740
<b>Mr. Koyanagi.</b>

15:15.910 --> 15:17.950
<b>I was mistaken.</b>

15:18.120 --> 15:19.460
<b>What do you mean?</b>

15:19.620 --> 15:23.590
<b>That's how I felt after I saw Ojun earlier.</b>

15:23.750 --> 15:27.760
<b>There is probably a small child at our next target.</b>

15:27.920 --> 15:31.340
<b>I hate to see another innocent child
go through such suffering.</b>

15:31.510 --> 15:32.510
<b>Then...</b>

15:32.680 --> 15:35.260
<b>I'll confess everything at court tomorrow.</b>

15:35.430 --> 15:36.600
<b>Very well.</b>

15:36.770 --> 15:38.560
<b>But before that,</b>

15:38.730 --> 15:40.190
<b>I have one favor to ask.</b>

15:40.350 --> 15:42.810
<b>What is it? Ask me anything.</b>

15:43.440 --> 15:45.770
<b>I don't mind being far away.</b>

15:45.940 --> 15:49.860
<b>But may I see Ojun one more time?</b>

15:50.030 --> 15:52.950
<b>It'll solidify my decision.</b>

15:59.750 --> 16:02.080
<b>This dear sight.</b>

16:02.830 --> 16:05.090
<b>Make sure it's burned into your memory.</b>

16:05.750 --> 16:07.380
<b>Yes.</b>

16:09.260 --> 16:11.840
<b>Ojun!</b>

16:12.010 --> 16:13.130
<b>Stop it, Gohei!</b>

16:13.300 --> 16:15.430
<b>Let me tell you something!</b>

16:15.600 --> 16:16.640
<b>Stop!</b>

16:16.810 --> 16:19.600
<b>Heizo Hasegawa is not your true father!</b>

16:19.770 --> 16:21.180
<b>Your father is a thief!</b>

16:23.190 --> 16:25.730
<b>I understand because I was the same too!</b>

16:25.900 --> 16:27.110
<b>Your father</b>

16:27.270 --> 16:28.610
<b>doesn't care about you.</b>

16:28.780 --> 16:31.820
<b>He doesn't like you at all!</b>

16:33.610 --> 16:36.450
<b>Seems like you can relate.</b>

16:37.120 --> 16:39.290
<b>Ojun, don't listen to him.</b>

16:39.450 --> 16:41.620
<b>Don't believe anything he says!</b>

16:50.590 --> 16:52.340
<b>I'm terribly sorry.</b>

16:52.510 --> 16:55.340
<b>It was all because of our carelessness.</b>

16:55.510 --> 16:58.180
<b>We are truly sorry.</b>

16:58.350 --> 17:00.430
<b>It's my fault.</b>

17:00.600 --> 17:03.180
<b>I should've been watching Ojun myself.</b>

17:03.350 --> 17:06.150
<b>That's enough. It's something she'll face eventually.</b>

17:06.310 --> 17:08.270
<b>So where's Ojun?</b>

17:08.440 --> 17:11.150
<b>Hikojyu is watching her, suggesting that</b>

17:11.320 --> 17:13.700
<b>it's better for her to be with others at this time.</b>

17:13.860 --> 17:15.530
<b>But...</b>

17:18.870 --> 17:20.700
<b>This is a disaster!</b>

17:20.870 --> 17:22.450
<b>When I looked away for a second,</b>

17:22.620 --> 17:25.210
<b>Ojun...Ojun...!</b>

17:25.370 --> 17:26.790
<b>What happened to her?</b>

17:26.960 --> 17:29.670
<b>I can't find her anywhere!</b>

17:34.510 --> 17:36.180
<b>Ojun!</b>

17:39.140 --> 17:40.720
<b>She's about this tall.</b>

17:40.890 --> 17:42.680
<b>We're looking for a young girl.</b>

17:47.270 --> 17:49.520
<b>She could still be in the house.</b>

17:49.690 --> 17:50.770
<b>Search everywhere!</b>

17:58.780 --> 18:00.530
<b>Ojun!</b>

18:01.660 --> 18:04.540
<b>Please come back...</b>

18:10.750 --> 18:12.170
<b>Darn it.</b>

18:12.340 --> 18:15.010
<b>Where are you, Ojun?</b>

18:19.800 --> 18:20.930
<b>Can she be...</b>

18:26.060 --> 18:27.640
<b>Ojun!</b>

18:44.790 --> 18:46.200
<b>Onihei...</b>

18:46.370 --> 18:49.040
<b>Can't wait to see the look on his face.</b>

18:55.380 --> 18:59.130
<b>We will now begin today's court.</b>

18:59.300 --> 19:01.720
<b>Wait a minute!</b>

19:03.180 --> 19:04.850
<b>Haven't you heard?</b>

19:05.140 --> 19:09.190
<b>What I told your daughter Ojun yesterday?</b>

19:09.350 --> 19:11.060
<b>Oh, about that.</b>

19:12.770 --> 19:14.570
<b>Actually...</b>

19:16.190 --> 19:18.150
<b>Ojun, wake up!</b>

19:18.320 --> 19:19.400
<b>Ojun!</b>

19:19.570 --> 19:21.280
<b>Ojun!</b>

19:24.450 --> 19:26.450
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:27.660 --> 19:28.870
<b>Ojun.</b>

19:29.040 --> 19:30.250
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:30.420 --> 19:33.080
<b>I'm sorry that I couldn't catch the sweetfish.</b>

19:35.630 --> 19:38.090
<b>You wanted to catch a sweetfish for me?</b>

19:38.590 --> 19:40.220
<b>Because...</b>

19:40.380 --> 19:41.430
<b>Because I'm...</b>

19:41.590 --> 19:44.890
<b>I'm not your real daughter...</b>

19:45.600 --> 19:47.470
<b>It doesn't matter what anyone says.</b>

19:47.640 --> 19:49.930
<b>Ojun, you're my precious daughter.</b>

19:50.100 --> 19:53.690
<b>I'm the one who has to apologize to you.</b>

19:54.190 --> 19:55.690
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:55.860 --> 19:58.780
<b>I'm sorry, Father.</b>

19:58.940 --> 20:00.860
<b>Everyone's waiting.</b>

20:01.030 --> 20:03.620
<b>Let's buy some sweetfish and head back.</b>

20:07.790 --> 20:09.370
<b>If only...</b>

20:10.000 --> 20:11.540
<b>If only...</b>

20:11.710 --> 20:15.290
<b>someone would've looked after you.</b>

20:21.470 --> 20:22.930
<b>You're all under arrest!</b>

20:23.090 --> 20:24.300
<b>Shinbei, the Viper's clan!</b>

20:24.470 --> 20:25.930
<b>Obey our orders!</b>

20:26.470 --> 20:27.970
<b>Never!</b>

20:30.890 --> 20:34.020
<b>This is Heizo Hasegawa of Arson Theft Control!</b>

20:34.190 --> 20:35.310
<b>Brace yourself!</b>

20:35.480 --> 20:37.360
<b>Those who resist will die!</b>

20:40.440 --> 20:42.450
<b>Are you sure about this?</b>

20:42.610 --> 20:44.530
<b>You choose to be executed?</b>

20:44.700 --> 20:46.950
<b>You have a choice to live and work under me.</b>

20:47.120 --> 20:48.620
<b>It's fine.</b>

20:48.790 --> 20:50.240
<b>I've lived long enough.</b>

20:50.790 --> 20:53.540
<b>You're not even 30 yet.</b>

20:53.710 --> 20:55.920
<b>It's not about age.</b>

20:56.080 --> 20:58.630
<b>I'm just tired of it all.</b>

21:00.670 --> 21:03.380
<b>Do you have a last wish?</b>

21:04.630 --> 21:06.840
<b>All right. I'll let you go.</b>

21:07.010 --> 21:08.680
<b>As a last wish...</b>

21:09.350 --> 21:11.430
<b>My last wish...</b>

21:16.560 --> 21:18.060
<b>Never mind.</b>

21:18.230 --> 21:21.940
<b>I can't let Heizo the Oni do this anyway.</b>

21:26.410 --> 21:27.820
<b>Thanks a lot.</b>

21:28.530 --> 21:30.830
<b>Goodbye, Otomatsu.</b>

21:41.300 --> 21:43.630
<b>Chief isn't looking too good.</b>

21:43.800 --> 21:46.430
<b>Ever since Gohei was executed.</b>

21:46.590 --> 21:48.300
<b>So it's been five days.</b>

21:48.470 --> 21:51.560
<b>He must be blaming himself.</b>

21:54.430 --> 21:55.940
<b>Father!</b>

21:56.100 --> 21:58.020
<b>Let's go out and play!</b>

21:58.190 --> 22:00.150
<b>Ojun! Watch what you wish for!</b>

22:01.320 --> 22:02.980
<b>Wait!</b>

22:04.990 --> 22:07.200
<b>Wait up, Ojun!</b>

22:21.210 --> 22:27.380
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.550 --> 22:33.220
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.390 --> 22:39.190
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.520 --> 22:44.940
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.900 --> 22:50.200
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.360 --> 22:54.200
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.370 --> 22:59.250
<b>in my next life</b>

23:00.120 --> 23:05.210
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:06.050 --> 23:11.430
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:12.140 --> 23:15.060
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.310 --> 23:23.690
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:27.070 --> 23:33.070
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:42.630 --> 23:45.880
<b>The pipe, a valuable keep-sake of
Heizo's father was stolen.</b>

23:46.340 --> 23:49.420
<b>And Heizo accidentally finds it.</b>

23:50.050 --> 23:53.180
<b>Next episode of Onihei
"Retreat of Okawa River"</b>
